      "writtenOn": "2021-12-14T07:48:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "setBluetoothTethering true while service is null will return TETHER_ERROR_INTERNAL_ERROR. I think this could happen because tethering and bluetooth are in different thread.\n\nSee more detail in this comment: \n\nhttps://android-review.googlesource.com/c/platform/packages/modules/Connectivity/+/1908683/9/Tethering/src/com/android/networkstack/tethering/Tethering.java#770",
